{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"1bd0ef8b7620f9f6b76b37c1e30ca12619b3e6bde228601883c88834ec63541b","slug":"1407-woba-anova","location":"/1407-woba-anova.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"포지션에 따라 평균 wOBA가 다를까?","description":"2026년 MLB 정규시즌 규정타석을 채운 타자의 wOBA를 비교하는 일원분산분석 R 실습","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"SeungGyu Bak","given":"SeungGyu","family":"Bak"},"name":"SeungGyu Bak","email":"seunggyu.bak@gmail.com","affiliations":["Q's Laboratory"],"id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0","corresponding":true}],"github":"https://github.com/esoterikosQ/QLab_book","affiliations":[{"id":"Q's Laboratory","name":"Q's Laboratory"}],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":2}},"source_url":"https://github.com/esoterikosQ/QLab_book/blob/main/1407-woba-anova.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/esoterikosQ/QLab_book/edit/main/1407-woba-anova.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"1407-woba-anova.md","url":"/_public/1407-woba-anova-3e4655c293099910ac8e28a60daf17c3.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2026년 메이저리그 정규시즌에 규정타석을 채운 타자의 시즌 wOBA를 주 포지션별로 비교한다. wOBA(weighted on-base average)는 타격 결과에 득점 기여도에 따른 가중치를 부여한 지표이다. 양대 리그 합산 502타석 이상인 선수를 포함한다. 162경기 정규시즌의 규정타석은 경기당 3.1타석을 적용해 계산한다. ","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"yRgIffQbKb"},{"type":"link","url":"https://library.fangraphs.com/offense/woba/","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"FanGraphs wOBA 설명","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"SHhtm1NcPf"}],"urlSource":"https://library.fangraphs.com/offense/woba/","key":"nxP20Ldetm"},{"type":"text","value":" · ","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"UTocfRQ61h"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.mlb.com/glossary/standard-stats/rate-stats-qualifiers","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"MLB 규정타석 기준","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"CQleifYBNx"}],"urlSource":"https://www.mlb.com/glossary/standard-stats/rate-stats-qualifiers","key":"j3lVjrWWoK"}],"key":"XY92FAHcHV"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"관측 단위는 선수 한 명이다. 선수마다 주 포지션 하나와 시즌 전체 wOBA 하나를 사용하며, 포지션별 평균을 계산할 때 선수에게 같은 가중치를 준다. RStudio에서 아래 R 코드 블록을 위에서부터 실행하면 된다. 데이터 조회에는 인터넷 연결이 필요하다.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"y1QOrJSBKq"}],"key":"bZCaKg5cfT"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. FanGraphs에서 규정타석 타자의 wOBA 가져오기","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"l4th1aTqRQ"}],"identifier":"id-1-fangraphs-woba","label":"1. FanGraphs에서 규정타석 타자의 wOBA 가져오기","html_id":"id-1-fangraphs-woba","implicit":true,"key":"MCWQdDpmu6"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"baseballr","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"UHQVDUm7KC"},{"type":"text","value":"의 ","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"YqNACeR2sT"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"fg_batter_leaders()","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"VOp0lu8ECD"},{"type":"text","value":"로 두 리그를 합산한 시즌 타격 기록을 가져온다. MLB 공식 기록과 연결하기 위해 FanGraphs 응답의 MLBAM 선수 ID(","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"vFDclmfsnS"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"xMLBAMID","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"WnLapBCju3"},{"type":"text","value":")를 남긴다. ","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"AjGypr7Ar7"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.fangraphs.com/leaders/major-league?pos=all&stats=bat&lg=all&qual=y&type=8&season=2026&month=0&season1=2026&ind=0","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2026년 FanGraphs 타격 리더보드","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"TlTevTtq0A"}],"urlSource":"https://www.fangraphs.com/leaders/major-league?pos=all&stats=bat&lg=all&qual=y&type=8&season=2026&month=0&season1=2026&ind=0","key":"FoesU5yclZ"},{"type":"text","value":" · ","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"nTzMcKAaaE"},{"type":"link","url":"https://billpetti.github.io/baseballr/reference/fg_batter_leaders.html","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"fg_batter_leaders()","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"MkEmQcL10B"},{"type":"text","value":" 문서","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"tmwTard1Wg"}],"urlSource":"https://billpetti.github.io/baseballr/reference/fg_batter_leaders.html","key":"iadYRE37eJ"}],"key":"GANJtVM7AN"},{"type":"code","lang":"r","value":"# 패키지 설치가 필요한 경우 실행\n# install.packages(c(\"baseballr\", \"dplyr\"))\nlibrary(baseballr)\nlibrary(dplyr)\n\nseason <- 2026\nmin_pa <- round(3.1 * 162)\nalpha <- 0.05\n\nbatting <- fg_batter_leaders(\n  startseason = season, endseason = season, lg = \"all\",\n  qual = as.character(min_pa), ind = \"0\"\n)\nif (is.null(batting) || nrow(batting) == 0L) {\n  stop(\"FanGraphs 타격 데이터를 불러오지 못했습니다.\")\n}\n\nqualified <- batting |>\n  filter(PA >= min_pa) |>\n  select(player_id = xMLBAMID, player = PlayerName, PA, wOBA)\nstopifnot(\n  nrow(qualified) > 0L,\n  !anyNA(qualified$player_id),\n  anyDuplicated(qualified$player_id) == 0L,\n  all(is.finite(qualified$wOBA))\n)","key":"WDX2OVEhyr"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 포지션별 타석으로 주 포지션 정하기","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"key":"yHXYu25F1u"}],"identifier":"id-2","label":"2. 포지션별 타석으로 주 포지션 정하기","html_id":"id-2","implicit":true,"key":"VEIoJrje7x"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"여러 포지션에서 뛴 선수는 ","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"Val3fkCaZh"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"가장 많은 타석을 기록한 포지션","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"IiubBFkoF7"}],"key":"bNd9pEcxqZ"},{"type":"text","value":"에 배정한다. 비교할 집단은 포수(C), 1루수(1B), 2루수(2B), 3루수(3B), 유격수(SS), 좌익수(LF), 중견수(CF), 우익수(RF), 지명타자(DH)이다. 타석 수가 같으면 아래 코드에 나열된 순서에서 앞선 포지션을 선택한다. ","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"zniG6zTw1H"},{"type":"link","url":"https://billpetti.github.io/baseballr/reference/mlb_stats.html","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mlb_stats()","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"WOncJbv3di"},{"type":"text","value":" 문서","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"bG1H0ZYDSt"}],"urlSource":"https://billpetti.github.io/baseballr/reference/mlb_stats.html","key":"PssA6UKgEz"},{"type":"text","value":" · ","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"tMTdMuzoB2"},{"type":"link","url":"https://statsapi.mlb.com/api/v1/situationCodes","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"MLB 포지션별 타격 조건 코드","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"ORsgaRWJK9"}],"urlSource":"https://statsapi.mlb.com/api/v1/situationCodes","key":"fy4osBbGF6"}],"key":"SZRnuY43Gz"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"MLB API의 조회 한도를 고려해 한 번에 1,000행씩 요청한다. ","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"UnAo6VB1CV"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"offset","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"StOBWwbbHJ"},{"type":"text","value":"에는 지금까지 받은 행 수를 넣어 다음 페이지부터 조회하고, 전체 행 수인 ","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"NOOv27pLDb"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"total_splits","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"ZOGBUlthrp"},{"type":"text","value":"에 도달하면 멈춘다. 페이지를 합친 뒤 전체 행 수와 선수·포지션 조합의 중복 여부를 확인한다.","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"dwwLWwp87w"}],"key":"DTwnbJygMo"},{"type":"code","lang":"r","value":"position_codes <- c(\n  p2 = \"C\", p3 = \"1B\", p4 = \"2B\", p5 = \"3B\", p6 = \"SS\",\n  p7 = \"LF\", p8 = \"CF\", p9 = \"RF\", pD = \"DH\"\n)\npage_size <- 1000L\noffset <- 0L\nsplit_pages <- list()\n\nrepeat {\n  page <- mlb_stats(\n    stat_type = \"statSplits\", stat_group = \"hitting\", player_pool = \"ALL\",\n    game_type = \"R\", season = season, sport_ids = 1,\n    sit_codes = names(position_codes),\n    sort_stat = \"plateAppearances\", order = \"desc\",\n    limit = page_size, offset = offset\n  )\n  if (is.null(page) || nrow(page) == 0L) {\n    stop(sprintf(\"MLB 포지션별 타석 조회에 실패했습니다 (offset = %d).\", offset))\n  }\n\n  split_pages[[length(split_pages) + 1L]] <- page\n  offset <- offset + nrow(page)\n  if (offset >= page$total_splits[[1L]]) {\n    break\n  }\n}\n\nsplits <- bind_rows(split_pages)\nstopifnot(\n  all(splits$total_splits == nrow(splits)),\n  anyDuplicated(splits[c(\"player_id\", \"split_code\")]) == 0L\n)\n\n# 선수별로 타석이 많은 포지션부터 정렬한 뒤 첫 행을 선택한다.\nprimary_positions <- splits |>\n  filter(split_code %in% names(position_codes), plate_appearances > 0) |>\n  mutate(position = factor(\n    unname(position_codes[split_code]), levels = unname(position_codes)\n  )) |>\n  arrange(player_id, desc(plate_appearances), position) |>\n  distinct(player_id, .keep_all = TRUE) |>\n  select(player_id, position)\n\nplayers <- qualified |>\n  left_join(primary_positions, by = \"player_id\")\nstopifnot(!anyNA(players$position))","key":"Joi9RMRMBl"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":100,"column":1},"end":{"line":100,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. 포지션별 분포와 일원분산분석","position":{"start":{"line":100,"column":1},"end":{"line":100,"column":1}},"key":"cRMapXJf9b"}],"identifier":"id-3","label":"3. 포지션별 분포와 일원분산분석","html_id":"id-3","implicit":true,"key":"e2tbiP5Gvt"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":102,"column":1},"end":{"line":102,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"포지션별 선수 수, 평균, 표준편차를 구하고 상자그림으로 분포를 비교한다.","position":{"start":{"line":102,"column":1},"end":{"line":102,"column":1}},"key":"zei41y9gO1"}],"key":"dUarPtkMZX"},{"type":"code","lang":"r","value":"position_summary <- players |>\n  group_by(position) |>\n  summarise(n = n(), mean_wOBA = mean(wOBA), sd_wOBA = sd(wOBA), .groups = \"drop\")\nprint(as.data.frame(position_summary), row.names = FALSE)\n\nboxplot(wOBA ~ position, data = players, xlab = \"Position\", ylab = \"wOBA\")","key":"Ba2UgkimpJ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":113,"column":1},"end":{"line":113,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"귀무가설 ","position":{"start":{"line":113,"column":1},"end":{"line":113,"column":1}},"key":"gxOWhUSESF"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"H_0","position":{"start":{"line":113,"column":1},"end":{"line":113,"column":1}},"html":"<span cl